<title>JAPAN: Japan MOF to deregulate pension management -- panel.</title>
<headline>Japan MOF to deregulate pension management -- panel.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Finance Ministry (MOF) pledged on Thursday to lift its controls on management of employee pension funds, a key member of an advisory panel to the prime minister said.</p>
</text>
